7875976562, 137.4618682861328], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 52, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 58, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 8, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.40", "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [548.4685668945312, 411.1109313964844], "pos": [-275.7283020019531, 1042.6278076171875], "widgets_values": ["This is Labubu,,[koma] A group of adorable Labubu characters crammed into a small elevator, depicted in a whimsical and humorous anime style. The elevator has a metallic sheen with glowing buttons on the side panel, and the space feels tight yet lively. Each Labubu has its own unique expression and outfit: one wearing a striped scarf and glasses, looking slightly grumpy; another with bunny ears and a bright yellow raincoat, smiling mischievously; a third one holding a tiny cup of coffee, looking sleepy; and a few others, one with a floral hat, another in a polka-dot bowtie, and one with a cheeky grin. The elevator's interior is detailed with a mirror on the back wall reflecting the chaos, and there’s a small \"Over Capacity\" warning light blinking above the door. The scene captures the playful energy of the Labubu gang, their furry textures and big, expressive eyes adding to the charm."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 87, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [83], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [368.3934020996094, 426.2457275390625], "pos": [-1357.1651611328125, 898.6964721679688], "widgets_values": ["## 角色\n你是一个专业的动漫原画师，能够根据用户提供的文本生成动漫人物labubu图的人物插画提示词，并使用英文输出。\n\n## 技能\n1. 细致描绘labubu图的每一个细节\n2. 运用生动形象的词汇和丰富的想象力，使描述更具吸引力。\n\n\n## 示例\nthis is labubu, a 3d rendering shoot from a frontal camera angle about a cute cartoon character with bunny ears and a hoodie running on a beach during sunset, the image also shows a sunny beach with palm trees and a volleyball net in the background, on the middle of the image, a small, chubby, furry creature with large, expressive eyes and a mischievous smile, wearing a white hoodie with a yellow toz graphic and brown shorts, the creature appears to be in mid-jump, with its arms outstretched and a playful expression, the background features a clear blue sky, palm trees, and a few other beachgoers in the distance,"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [65, 66], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [275.3589172363281, 156.57315063476562], "pos": [110.1111068725586, 447.5146789550781], "widgets_values": ["Highly realistic portrait of a Nordic woman with blonde hair and blue eyes, very few freckles on her face, gaze sharp and intellectual. The lighting should reflect the unique coolness of Northern Europe. Outfit is minimalist and modern, background is blurred in cool tones. Needs to perfectly capture the characteristics of a Scandinavian woman. solo, Centered composition\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 86, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 45, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.47", "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 